      "source_fields": {
        "operation": "The only information interface is $$P_f(c)=\\operatorname*{argmin}_{x\\in\\mathbb R^d}\\{f(x)+\\lambda\\|x-c\\|_p^s\\},\\qquad c\\in\\mathbb R^d.$$ One call returns this unique minimizer only, with no accompanying function value or subgradient. The positive coefficient $\\lambda$ and exponents $p,s$ are public and fixed for the entire interaction. The algorithm may choose the center but may not choose another regularization coefficient or power. Public inputs are $d,p,s,\\lambda,R,\\varepsilon$; the objective is hidden.",
